# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and add the same values in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Leave them empty to run the app in demo mode (fake data saved in your browser).
# Both are safe to expose in the browser; access is enforced by the rules in supabase/schema.sql.

